      "summary": "The orders p95 latency of about 4.2s is caused by waiting for a database connection, not by the queries themselves. Orders' HikariPool-1 is full (20 of 20 connections in use, 0 idle, 212 requests waiting). Requests sit in pool.acquire for about 4.15s at p95, and some give up after the 30s Hikari timeout and fail. The window before the alert looks identical in aggregate (ev9), so I can't say when this started.",
